        <tei:div xml:id="morning_tallit">
          <tei:head xml:lang="he">סֵֽדֶר עֲטִיפַת הַטַּלִּית.</tei:head>
          <tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n24.jpg">Before draping oneself in the <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">טלית</tei:foreign> the following is said:</tei:note>
          <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/hineni_mitattef@prayerbook_for_the_new_year_second_day-heidenheim-1965-he"/>
          <tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n24.jpg">Then this <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">ברכה</tei:foreign> is recited while standing:</tei:note>
          <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/lehitattef@prayerbook_for_the_new_year_second_day-heidenheim-1965-he"/>
          <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n24.jpg">One then drapes oneself in the <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">טלית</tei:foreign> and says:</tei:note>
          <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/mah_yaqar@prayerbook_for_the_new_year_second_day-heidenheim-1965-he"/>
          <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/yehi_ratzon@prayerbook_for_the_new_year_second_day-heidenheim-1965-he"/>
          <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n24.jpg">One then removes the <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">טלית</tei:foreign> from the face and drapes oneself in such a way that there should be one <tei:foreign xml:lang="he">ציצת</tei:foreign> in front and one behind on each side.</tei:note>
        </tei:div>
